{title: Siempre me sostiene}
{artist: Gateway Worship}
{key: A}
{source: https://acordes.lacuerda.net/gateway_worship/siempre_me_sostiene.shtml}

{start_of_intro}
[F#m]   [Esus4]   [Dadd9]   [A]
[F#m]   [Esus4]   [Dadd9]   [A]
[F#m]   [Esus4]   [Dadd9]   [A]
[F#m]   [Esus4]   [Dadd9]   [A]
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse: Verso I}
[F#m]         [E]      [Dadd9] [A]
Cuando perdido estaba
[F#m]         [E]      [Dadd9] [A]
Fuiste mi amigo fiel
   [F#m]       [E]        [Dadd9]   [A]
Llamaste mi nombre y te escuché
  [F#m]       [E]         [Dadd9] [A]
Mi vida en ti encontré
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_interlude}
[F#m]   [Esus4]   [Dadd9]   [A]
[F#m]   [Esus4]   [Dadd9]   [A]
{end_of_interlude}

{start_of_verse: Verso II}
[F#m]          [E]       [Dadd9] [A]
Cuando sin rumbo estaba
[F#m]           [E]      [Dadd9] [A]
Tu luz alumbró mi ser
   [F#m]       [E]     [Dadd9]  [A]
Esclavo fui del pecado en mí
   [F#m]       [E]        [Dadd9] [A]
Mas vida en Ti encontré
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[F#m] [E]    [Dadd9]    [A]       [F#m] [E]
Oh tu amor siempre estará
  [Dadd9]  [A]     [F#m]
Jamás me soltará
       [E]      [Dadd9]   [A]
Vas conmigo, Tú eres fiel
    [F#m]       [E]         [Dadd9] [A]
Tu amor siempre me sostiene, rey
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_interlude}
[F#m]   [Esus4]   [Dadd9]   [A]
{end_of_interlude}

{start_of_verse: Verso 3}
  [F#m]       [E]        [Dadd9] [A]
En Ti soy nueva criatura
  [F#m]       [E]        [Dadd9] [A]
Hoy dejo el pasado atrás
  [F#m]       [E]        [Dadd9] [A]
Perdido yo estaba en mi dolor
  [F#m]       [E]    [Dadd9] [A]
Tu amor me alcanzó, Señor
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F#m] [E]    [Dadd9]    [A]       [F#m] [E]
Oh tu amor siempre estará
  [Dadd9]  [A]     [F#m]
